      "en": "It was square. They made the breastplate double. Its length was a span, and its width a span, being double.",
      "ko": "그것의 장이 한 뼘, 광이 한 뼘으로 네모 반듯하고 두 겹이며",
      "source_text_hash": "d75245ab0f99128ffff57ecfb31a8dafe0ae77ba7fb779e510f40fc1f3d76729",
