      "en": "They set in it four rows of stones. A row of ruby, topaz, and beryl was the first row;",
      "ko": "그것에 네 줄 보석을 물렸으니 곧 홍보석 황옥 녹주옥이 첫 줄이요",
      "source_text_hash": "aa725557402e7bc2ee1a1585cf73d7ecdb7ecde3c14f98c4dfd937390ea635a3",
      "translation_text_hash": "a31ce1f6b48ec3e79b54d2a33343dfc3a1175df59568fa37786941d7108be3e5",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "그것에 네 줄 보석을 물렸으니 곧 홍보석 황옥 녹주옥이 첫 줄이요"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "a31ce1f6b48ec3e79b54d2a33343dfc3a1175df59568fa37786941d7108be3e5"
      ]
