      "ko": "둘째 줄은 석류석 남보석 홍마노요",
      "source_text_hash": "ab6bc83997ea5b7e441e6792d894a80bca58b6976716773345c8ae532ee66f9c",
      "translation_text_hash": "4aa5f173d71bc1c817d927eb1f6ef348df2c13cd7062f60910a856f96a7fedc9",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
